{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日本扭蛋品牌「BushiCapsule」推出全新原創系列，將力量與優雅完美結合，帶來華麗翩翩起舞的猩猩芭蕾舞者——「Gorrellina」扭蛋系列！這款作品特別講究大猩猩獨有的肌肉線條美感與毛髮質感，同時展現出芭蕾舞姿的優雅與華麗，打造出既粗獷又萌趣的「硬派可愛」獨特風格。全系列共推出 5 款（包含 1 款隱藏版），並以芭蕾舞的法文計數命名，好想扭全套回家，和猩猩一起跳舞！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178560008649845306_5502502176a6e1856b5964.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178560008792064345_6441359646a6e185814903.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178560008914078891_4809946446a6e18598a414.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178560009109471760_20421776096a6e185b5e439.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-01T16:18:36.573214+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":255,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}